Stockfish
---------
Stockfish, GNU General Public License version 3: legal/stockfish.txt. Stockfish is a separate
program: chess-coach starts it as a child process and talks to it over the UCI protocol, and
never links any of its code. The macOS application bundles a Stockfish binary in
chess-coach.app/Contents/Resources/engine/, with the licence text beside it (COPYING) and the
exact version, a link to its source and how the binary was obtained (SOURCE.txt).
    https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish

